        "original_id": "ff85ec26-f6b1-5f7c-b46f-1392913bbe43",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cam Clarke, Katsuhiro Otomo, Ryōhei Suzuki, Shunzō Katō, Izo Hashimoto, Anna Paquin, Kirby Morrow, Garry Chalk, Ron Halder, Nicole Oliver\n- Works: Akira, Mosaic\n- Roles: voice actor, singer, director, producer, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Cam Clarke was born on November 6, 1957.\n- Cam Clarke is an American voice actor and singer known for voice work in animation and video games.\n- Akira is a 1988 Japanese adult animated science fiction film.\n- Katsuhiro Otomo directed Akira and co-wrote it with Izo Hashimoto.\n- Ryōhei Suzuki and Shunzō Katō produced Akira.\n- Akira was based on Katsuhiro Otomo's manga of the same name.\n- Mosaic features Anna Paquin as Maggie Nelson.\n- Mosaic has supporting voice roles by Kirby Morrow, Cam Clarke, Garry Chalk, Ron Halder, and Nicole Oliver.",
